The library embeds a Bambu Lab application client_auth_secret and uses it to
fetch the slicer signing certificate chain from Bambu's cloud, so cloud
signing works without manual certificate extraction. That secret is recovered
from a running Bambu Studio process with tools/extract_key_from_dump.py in
open-bamboo-networking, a script written by mitchcapper
(https://github.com/mitchcapper). This is not a clean-room implementation and
must not be described as one.

